<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 3.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 3.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timetable for the second day of</p>
<p>competition at the world athletics championships on Sunday (all</p>
<p>times GMT):</p>
<p>0500 - Heptathlon - 100 metres hurdles</p>
<p>0510 - Men's javelin qualifying round, group A</p>
<p>0520 - Men's long jump qualifying round, two groups</p>
<p>0530 - 3,000 steeplechase first round</p>
<p>0600 - Heptathlon - high jump</p>
<p>0615 - Men's 400 metres first round</p>
<p>0700 - Men's javelin qualifying round, group B</p>
<p>1430 - Men's hammer final</p>
<p>1500 - Men's 400 metres second round</p>
<p>1530 - Women's 100 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1550 - Men's 100 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1600 - Heptathlon - shot put</p>
<p>1620 - Women's 400 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1650 - Men's 1,500 metres first round</p>
<p>1735 - Women's 1,500 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1805 - Men's 400 metres hurdles semifinals</p>
<p>1835 - Women's 100 metres final</p>
<p>1850 - Men's 100 metres final</p>
<p>1905 - Heptathlon - 200 metres</p>
<p>1925 - Men's 10,000 metres first round</p>
</text>
